.TH git-harvest 1  "git-harvest 0.4.1" 
.SH NAME
git\-harvest \- Harvest a CHANGELOG from your Git history.
.SH SYNOPSIS
\fBgit\-harvest\fR [\fB\-h\fR|\fB\-\-help\fR] [\fB\-V\fR|\fB\-\-version\fR] [\fIsubcommands\fR]
.SH DESCRIPTION
Harvest a CHANGELOG from a repository\*(Aqs Git history.
.PP
`git\-harvest` produces a Keep a Changelog\-style CHANGELOG from a Git repository\*(Aqs commit history in two passes.  `scan` harvests the structured commits on the current branch into a fragment file under `changelog.d/`; `assemble` later folds every pending fragment into a new released section of the CHANGELOG, deleting the fragments it consumes.  `render` exports the released history as Markdown, `id` registers and maintains the contributor registry both passes consult, and `licences` reproduces the licence notices of `git\-harvest` and its own dependencies.  With no task given, `scan` runs with its own defaults.
.SH OPTIONS
.TP
\fB\-h\fR, \fB\-\-help\fR
Print help (see a summary with \*(Aq\-h\*(Aq)
.TP
\fB\-V\fR, \fB\-\-version\fR
Print version
.SH SUBCOMMANDS
.TP
git\-harvest\-assemble(1)
Merge the harvested fragments into a new CHANGELOG section
.TP
git\-harvest\-id(1)
Register and maintain the CHANGELOG\*(Aqs contributor registry
.TP
git\-harvest\-init(1)
Write a fresh CHANGELOG carrying the default configuration
.TP
git\-harvest\-licences(1)
Show the licences of this application and its dependencies
.TP
git\-harvest\-render(1)
Render the CHANGELOG as a Keep a Changelog Markdown file
.TP
git\-harvest\-scan(1)
Harvest this branch\*(Aqs structured commits into a fragment
.SH VERSION
v0.4.1
